# Audited: the first item over 2 is 3 and the op's step gives 0; LastOf's entry and its call of Last are the two cycles, and the last even of 1 to 5 is 4.
# The written types' tests: declarations of be-inference.prism (Semantics chapter 6).

test the_types_are_written, @Shown [[1, 2, 3, 4, 5]]:
    build
    compute until idle
        => expect Ui.Label(text="30 4")
